{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1528416000, "end_date": 1529107199, "month_true_total": 90, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:14:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42741666", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039895150", "personaname": "Tib", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dudewhatismyname/", "num_games_owned": 377, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10815, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9727, "last_played": 1530025736, "avatar": "50767cea96889a121066ed45c098873cb258f8f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is honestly such a gem.\n\nI own it for both PC and on my PS Vita and I enjoy playing it every single time. It's fast, it's punchy.\nIt scratches that itch for challenging gameplay without ever being unfair.\n\nTo call it the \"Dark Souls of Rogue-likes\" is doing it a disservice. It's so much of it's own game, and has so much character.\n\nThe sound track is gorgeous. All the little death and hit sounds are on point. Everything just feels like it's been put there with care.\n\nHoopoo really cared about this game, and I hope the second one will be just as good if not better.\n\nThank you for a game I can always come back to.", "timestamp_created": 1529067447, "timestamp_updated": 1529067447, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.667513668537139893", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42737387", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027552148", "personaname": "Thock", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027552148/", "num_games_owned": 346, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1688, "playtime_last_tw